  "prefLabel": "Plc 502.02 Approved provider",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 502.02 “Approved provider” means an organization that has been approved by the executive director pursuant to Plc 503 to provide case-management services, coordinate continuing care, and document appropriate illness management for treatment and monitoring plans for licensees who have or who potentially have an impairment.\n\nSource. #13971, eff 7-1-24",
